      },
      "text": "```\nN₂ STABILITY:\n  N≡N triple bond energy: 945 kJ/mol (most stable homonuclear diatomic after CO)\n  Bond dissociation requires ~3000 K in the absence of catalysts\n  → atmospheric N₂ is essentially biologically inert (despite being 78% of air)"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-LIFE-NONMETALS.md#023",
      "path": [
        "06-LIFE-NONMETALS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:periodic-table:06-life-nonmetals, git-history:periodic-table:06-life-nonmetals]",
        "canonical_path": "periodic-table/06-LIFE-NONMETALS.md",
