        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "The Life Nonmetals - C, N, O, P, S",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CONSEQUENCE:\n  Life needs fixed nitrogen (NH₃, NO₃⁻, amino groups) but N₂ is unavailable.\n  Before Haber-Bosch: available fixed N from guano (bird/bat droppings), Chile saltpeter\n  (NaNO₃), and biological nitrogen fixation."
    },
    {
      "id": "06-LIFE-NONMETALS.md#024",
      "path": [
        "06-LIFE-NONMETALS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
