        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "The Life Nonmetals - C, N, O, P, S",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "BIOLOGICAL NITROGEN FIXATION:\n  N₂ + 8H⁺ + 8e⁻ + 16 ATP → 2 NH₃ + H₂ + 16 ADP + 16 Pi  (nitrogenase enzyme)\n  Enzyme: Mo-Fe nitrogenase (most common); also V-Fe and Fe-only nitrogenase\n  Organisms: Rhizobium (root nodules of legumes), Azotobacter (free-living), cyanobacteria\n  Problem: O₂ irreversibly destroys nitrogenase → legume nodules maintain micro-anaerobic zone"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-LIFE-NONMETALS.md#025",
      "path": [
        "06-LIFE-NONMETALS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
