        "section": "periodic-table",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "The Life Nonmetals - C, N, O, P, S",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "NITROGEN CYCLE:\n  N₂ → NH₃ (fixation: biological or Haber-Bosch)\n  NH₃ → NO₂⁻ → NO₃⁻ (nitrification: Nitrosomonas → Nitrobacter)\n  NO₃⁻ → N₂ (denitrification: Pseudomonas in anaerobic soils)\n  Organic N → NH₄⁺ (ammonification)\n```"
    },
