      "text": "```\nTHE HABER-BOSCH PROCESS:\n  N₂ + 3 H₂ ⇌ 2 NH₃    ΔH = −92 kJ/mol (exothermic)"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-LIFE-NONMETALS.md#028",
      "path": [
        "06-LIFE-NONMETALS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
