        "title": "The Life Nonmetals - C, N, O, P, S",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "THERMODYNAMICS vs KINETICS:\n    Low T → favors NH₃ (Le Chatelier: exothermic + decreasing moles of gas)\n    Low T → too slow for industrial production (activation energy ~240 kJ/mol)\n    Compromise: 400–500°C, 150–300 atm, Fe catalyst (with K₂O and Al₂O₃ promoters)\n    Conversion: only ~15-25% per pass → unreacted gases recycled"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-LIFE-NONMETALS.md#029",
