      },
      "text": "CATALYST MECHANISM:\n    Rate-limiting step: N₂ adsorption and dissociation on Fe surface\n    K₂O (electronic promoter): increases electron density on Fe → better N₂ binding\n    Al₂O₃ (structural promoter): prevents Fe sintering at high T"
    },
